  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d29874e3b4e59e549ab8ca779e34be5a, type: 3}
  m_Name: Earth_0-Discovery of human
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  speakerName: T.I.I.G.E.R
  paragraphs:
  - "%Incoming transmission:ACCEPTED|\r\n**start(bootSetup):!!1stackTraceERROR|\r\n(IFNULL)\u2026---|\r\n\rSUCCESS!|\n"
  - "Who\u2019s this? Is this a Caddix? Finally returning to their course?!"
  - "Hold on, you aren\u2019t a Caddix! You\u2019re some other\u2026 alien creature\u2026 "
  - "A \u2018human\u2019 you say. What kind of name for a species is that? And your
    anatomy, it\u2019s so\u2026 imperfect. 2 hands!"
  - "It\u2019s universal knowledge that 3 is the optimal number for golfing. And
    2 eyes, 2 legs, 2 ears, what is it with your species and the number 2?"
  - "I\u2019ve been here for a billion years, tending to this golf course by myself,
    waiting for my creators, the Caddi forerunners, to return. But instead, I get
    you? A \u2018human.\u2019 What does your species even offer?"
  - Yes, I said golf, as that is my obviously my purpose. For I am the Technological
    Intelligence for Intergalactic Golfing Environmental Reconnaissance, AKA TIIGER.@
  - "My sole purpose is to tend to this golf course built by the Caddi, wherever
    they may be\u2026"
  - 'What?! Your species plays golf? That must be some sort of universal crime! '
  - "No. I don\u2019t believe it. If your species really does play golf, why don\u2019t
    you go ahead and show me. Let\u2019s see if you can even complete this hole \u2013
    probably the easiest of them all. "
  revealNameLater: 1
  hiddenSpeakerName: ???
